        "description": "<p><span>\n\nIn 1992 </span>\n\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tony_Parkes_(caller)\">Tony\nParkes</a>, one of the best-known New England contra dance callers,\nwrote a book: \n\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Contra-Dance-Calling-Basic-Second/dp/0963288032%22\">Contra\nDance Calling: a Basic Text</a>.  In 2010 he published an updated\nsecond edition.  I found used copies of each and read through them,\ninterested in both what he thought, and what he thought to change.\n\n\n\n<p>\n\n<a highlight href=\"https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dance-calling-a-basic-text-both-editions-big.jpg\"><img src=\"https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dance-calling-a-basic-text-both-editions.jpg\" width=\"550\" height=\"414\" class=\"mobile-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:100.0vw; max-height:75.3vw;\" srcset=\"https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dance-calling-a-basic-text-both-editions.jpg 550w,https://www.jefftk.com/contra-dance-calling-a-basic-text-both-editions-2x.jpg 1100w\"><div style=\"height:min(75.3vw, 414px)\" class=\"image-vertical-spacer",
